    salvation: "By grace alone through faith alone. A verdict for Christ's sake.",
    baptism: "Infants baptized. Baptism gives new birth and faith.",
    eucharist: "Christ's true body and blood in, with and under the bread and wine.",
    sacraments: "Two, sometimes with absolution as a third.",
    polity: "Varies: bishops in Scandinavia, synods and congregations elsewhere.",
    clergy: "Married pastors. Many bodies ordain women, some do not.",
